        35468003) = (Observation/Event, standard_concept=S), the Athena crosswalk target for parent W23.
        Why this target: every SE child of W23 denotes a caught/crushed-in-between-objects event;
        4146976 fully subsumes the mechanism axis. The place/activity detail has no current standard
        concept (the [X].occurrence-at-. SNOMED CT concepts are all retired invalid_reason=U). Why this
        tier: moderate: best available standard concept, but the target drops two axes of specificity
        (place and activity); the place-specific SNOMED CT equivalents (concept ids 40420596/44793994
        (220595002)) exist but are retired/invalid (invalid_reason=U, valid_end_date 2009/2015), leaving
        only the parent mechanism concept as a standard target.
        """
}
